Object.assign(window.I18N['zh-SG'].text, {
  "Chapter 12": "第十二章",
  "Closeness": "亲近",
  "Chapter 13 — Health Class": "第十三章 · 健康教育课",
  "Year-end holidays. No school, long afternoons, the whole of December lying there like a cat in the sun.": "年底假期。不用上学，下午长长的，整个十二月像一只晒太阳的猫一样摊在那里。",
  "Movie night at your flat. Mum is in the kitchen, very loudly pretending not to listen. The credits roll. It's quiet.": "在你家看电影。妈妈在厨房，非常大声地假装没在听。片尾字幕跑了。好安静。",
  "I want to kiss her. I really, really want to kiss her.": "我想亲她。真的、真的很想。",
  "A quiet moment...": "安静的一刻……",
  "Ask: \"Can I kiss you?\"": "问：“我可以亲你吗？”",
  "...Yes. I was hoping you'd ask.": "……可以。我一直在等你问。",
  "It's short and a bit clumsy and you'll remember it for the rest of your life.": "很短，有点笨拙，而你会记一辈子。",
  "Not yet? I like you a lot. I'm just... not there yet. Is that okay?": "还没？我很喜欢你。只是……还没准备好。可以吗？",
  "She said \"not yet\".": "她说“还没”。",
  "\"Of course can. Thanks for telling me.\" And mean it.": "“当然可以。谢谢你跟我说。”而且是真心的。",
  "You're the first person I felt okay saying that to. ...Movie again next week?": "你是第一个让我敢这样讲的人。……下礼拜再看一部？",
  "Sulk through the credits.": "整个片尾都在闷闷不乐。",
  "She was honest, and you made it cost something. Let it grow at its own pace.": "她老实说了，你却让老实变得有代价。让它按自己的速度长吧。",
  "Keep asking. \"Come on, one only.\"": "一直问。“来啦，一下就好。”",
  "I said not yet. I want to go home now.": "我说了还没。我现在想回家。",
  "BAD END #15 — Movie Over": "坏结局 #15 · 电影散场",
  "\"Not yet\" means not yet. Asking again and again after an answer is pressure, and pressure is the opposite of consent. Respecting the first answer is what makes the next yes real.": "“还没”就是还没。得到答案后还一直问，就是施压，而施压是同意的反面。尊重第一个答案，下一个“好”才是真的。",
  "\"If you really liked me, you would.\"": "“如果你真的喜欢我，你就会。”",
  "That's... not fair. Liking you has nothing to do with being ready.": "这样……不公平。喜不喜欢你，跟有没有准备好，是两回事。",
  "Just lean in without asking.": "不问，直接靠过去。",
  "She turns her head away just in time. The silence is very loud. Mum coughs in the kitchen.": "她及时把头转开。沉默非常大声。妈妈在厨房咳了一声。",
  "Asking isn't unromantic. Guessing wrong is.": "问一句不会不浪漫。猜错才会。",
  "bro couples send each other pics. ask her 😏": "兄弟，情侣都会互传照片的。去问她😏",
  "Haziq is being Haziq.": "哈齐克又在哈齐克了。",
  "\"No. Never.\" And say why.": "“不要。绝对不要。”然后讲原因。",
  "no. she's 17. asking for, keeping or forwarding a sexual image of someone her age can be a crime here. and sharing anyone's private image without consent is a crime at any age.": "不要。她17岁。在这里，跟她这个年纪的人要、留着或转发性相关的照片，都可能犯法。而且没经过同意分享任何人的私密照，不管几岁都是犯法的。",
  "wait serious?? ok deleting this msg. thanks bro": "等等真的假的？？好我删掉这条。谢啦兄弟",
  "Ask her for a private photo.": "跟她要私密照。",
  "why would you ask me that? that really scared me.": "你为什么要问我这个？我真的被吓到了。",
  "She's hurt and scared.": "她很受伤，也很害怕。",
  "Apologise properly. Never ask again.": "好好道歉。永远不再问。",
  "you're right. I'm sorry. I won't ask again, ever. that was wrong of me.": "你说得对。对不起。我以后永远不会再问。那是我错了。",
  "Keep asking, and say you'll show the boys you're \"legit\".": "继续要，还说要给男生们看证明你是“来真的”。",
  "BAD END #16 — Screenshot Forever": "坏结局 #16 · 截图永存",
  "Pressuring someone for intimate images, and threatening to share them, is abuse. In Singapore, sexual images of anyone under 16 are child abuse material, getting a 16- or 17-year-old to make one can also be an offence, and sharing or threatening to share anyone's intimate image without consent is an offence at any age. Once an image is out, it may never fully come back.": "逼别人给私密照，还威胁要分享出去，就是虐待。在新加坡，未满16岁者的性相关图像属于儿童性虐待材料；让16或17岁的人拍这种照片也可能犯法；不管对方几岁，未经同意分享或威胁分享私密照都是罪行。照片一旦流出去，可能永远收不回来。",
  "Her birthday's next week. HUGE surprise party. Thirty people, balloons, a cake with her face printed on it...": "她下礼拜生日。超大型惊喜派对。三十个人、气球、印着她脸的蛋糕……",
  "She's told me twice she hates surprises. But this one is different. Right?": "她跟我说过两次她讨厌惊喜。不过这次不一样吧？对吧？",
  "The surprise party...": "惊喜派对……",
  "Cancel it. Plan what she actually likes.": "取消。安排她真正喜欢的。",
  "Three friends, her favourite food, and you tell her the plan a week ahead. She smiles the whole night.": "三个朋友、她最爱的食物，而且你一个礼拜前就跟她讲好计划。她整晚都在笑。",
  "Do it anyway. \"She'll love it once she sees it.\"": "照办。“她看到就会喜欢的。”",
  "Thank you. Really. Can I... go home early? I told you I hate this.": "谢谢。真的。我可以……早点回家吗？我跟你说过我讨厌这个的。",
  "Sunday lunch at Hanis's grandmother's flat in Geylang Serai. Twenty relatives, rendang and ketupat, and every single one of them is looking at you.": "礼拜天，在哈妮丝阿嫲芽笼士乃的组屋吃午餐。二十个亲戚、仁当和马来粽，每一个都在看你。",
  "Xin Yi's grandmother's 80th birthday dinner at her aunt's place. Twenty relatives, longevity noodles and peach buns, and every single one of them is looking at you.": "欣怡阿嫲八十大寿，在她阿姨家吃晚饭。二十个亲戚、长寿面和寿桃包，每一个都在看你。",
  "Kavya's cousin's engagement lunch at her family's place. Twenty relatives, murukku and mutton varuval, and every single one of them is looking at you.": "卡维娅表姐的订婚午宴，在她家。二十个亲戚、印度脆饼和干炒羊肉，每一个都在看你。",
  "Christmas lunch with Elise's Eurasian family. Twenty relatives, devil's curry and sugee cake, and every single one of them is looking at you.": "在伊莉丝的欧亚裔家庭吃圣诞午餐。二十个亲戚、魔鬼咖喱和苏吉蛋糕，每一个都在看你。",
  "Reunion dinner at Chloe's family's flat above the kopitiam, after the stall closes. Twenty relatives, steamboat and pineapple tarts, and every single one of them is looking at you.": "小贩摊收档后，在可儿家咖啡店楼上的组屋吃团圆饭。二十个亲戚，火锅和黄梨挞，每一个人都在看你。",
  "Gurpurab at Preet's family's gurdwara, then lunch at her uncle's place. Twenty relatives, langar dal and parathas, and every single one of them is looking at you.": "在普丽特家的谒师所过古鲁诞辰节，然后去她舅舅家吃午饭。二十个亲戚，免费餐的豆汤和印度薄饼，每一个人都在看你。",
  "Friendsgiving at Ava's condo by East Coast. Her dad has smoked a Texas brisket for fourteen hours, her mum has invited half the condo, and every single one of them is looking at you.": "东海岸艾娃家公寓的Friendsgiving感恩聚会。她爸烟熏了一块德州牛胸肉整整十四个小时，她妈邀了半栋公寓的人，而每一个人都在看你。",
  "How do you handle her people?": "她的家人，你怎么应对？",
  "Follow the house's customs, ask her relatives real questions, help clear the plates, phone in pocket.": "照这个家的规矩来，认真问她亲戚问题，帮忙收碗，手机收进口袋。",
  "Shoes off at the door, salam her grandmother properly, and a tin of kuih from a halal bakery.": "门口脱鞋，好好跟她阿嫲行礼问好，带一罐清真糕点店买的糕。",
  "You bring two mandarin oranges, greet every elder by the right title, and avoid saying \"four\" all night. When Joy, who helps look after Xin Yi's grandmother, brings out the soup, you get up to help and thank her by name.": "你带了两粒柑，每个长辈都叫对称呼，整晚不说“四”。帮忙照顾欣怡阿嫲的乔伊端汤出来时，你起身帮忙，还叫着她的名字道谢。",
  "Shoes off, a real compliment for the kolam at the door, and yes to the third helping of murukku.": "脱鞋，真心称赞门口的米粉画，第三份印度脆饼也照收。",
  "You bring a card for her grandmother, call her \"Granny\" because she insists, and say yes to more sugee cake.": "你带了一张卡片给她外婆，因为她坚持，你就叫她“Granny”，苏吉蛋糕再来一块也说好。",
  "You bring two mandarin oranges, greet her grandfather first, and spend twenty minutes washing steamboat ladles with her cousins.": "你带了两粒柑，先跟她爷爷拜年，然后跟她的表兄弟姐妹洗了二十分钟的火锅勺。",
  "You cover your head at the gurdwara, sit on the floor for langar, help wash the steel plates, and say \"Sat Sri Akal\" to her grandmother.": "你在谒师所把头包好，坐在地上吃免费餐，帮忙洗钢盘，还用旁遮普语跟她奶奶说“Sat Sri Akal”问好。",
  "You bring Ah Ma's ngoh hiang in a tingkat and call her dad \"Uncle\". He laughs: \"Call me Mike.\" You try. It comes out as \"Uncle Mike\", and he decides he loves it.": "你用一个tingkat提着阿嬷的五香卷去，叫她爸“Uncle”。他笑了：“叫我Mike就好。”你试了。说出口变成“Uncle Mike”，他决定他超喜欢这个称呼。",
  "My aunty just asked if you're coming next year. In my family that's the highest honour.": "我阿姨刚刚问你明年还会不会来。在我们家，这是最高荣誉。",
  "Stay on your phone and joke that her cousins are \"boring\".": "一直滑手机，还开玩笑说她表亲很“无聊”。",
  "Those are my people. If you can't like them, at least be nice to them.": "那些是我的家人。你可以不喜欢，但至少要客气。",
  "Try too hard. Tell everyone your grades.": "太用力了。跟每个人报你的成绩。",
  "An uncle asks three follow-up questions about your grades. You did not prepare for follow-up questions.": "一个安哥针对你的成绩追问了三个问题。你完全没准备被追问。",
  "At {her}'s family dinner, an aunty asks how much you plan to earn. Later, {her}: \"Does my family's opinion matter to you?\"": "在{her}家的饭桌上，一个阿姨问你打算赚多少。之后{her}问：“我家人的意见对你重要吗？”",
  "\"It matters. Maybe differently from how it matters to you. How much say do they have, for you?\"": "“重要。可能跟你的重要不太一样。对你来说，他们有多少话语权？”",
  "\"I respect them, but our decisions should be ours.\"": "“我尊重他们，但我们的决定是我们的。”",
  "\"I want to listen to them, and still decide together.\"": "“我会听他们的，然后我们一起决定。”",
  "\"Family comes first. Their blessing matters a lot to me.\"": "“家人第一。他们的祝福对我很重要。”",
  "\"Your family is quite kaypoh, honestly.\"": "“老实讲，你家人有点八卦。”",
  "East Coast Park. Cycling, satay, and some boys from your class at the next table, rating girls who walk past.": "东海岸公园。骑脚车、吃沙爹，隔壁桌是你班上几个男生，在给经过的女生打分。",
  "Eh, your girlfriend ah, quite— you know. Rate lah. Out of ten.": "诶，你女朋友啊，蛮——你懂的。打个分啦。满分十分。",
  "They're waiting for you to join in.": "他们在等你加入。",
  "\"Not cool, man.\" Change the topic.": "“这样很不OK。”换话题。",
  "...Okay okay. Relax. Satay?": "……好啦好啦。放轻松。沙爹？",
  "Make a joke about her body for a laugh.": "拿她的身材开玩笑逗大家笑。",
  "The laugh lasts four seconds. By Monday one of them has told her. She stops wearing that dress.": "笑声持续了四秒。礼拜一之前，其中一个就跟她讲了。她再也没穿那件裙子。",
  "Laugh awkwardly. Say nothing.": "尴尬地笑。什么都不说。",
  "To them, silence sounds like yes. One sentence would've done it.": "对他们来说，沉默听起来就是同意。一句话就够了。",
  "Later that week, walking her home. At the lift lobby she pulls you closer. She wants to go faster than you're ready for.": "那个礼拜稍晚，送她回家。在电梯口，她把你拉近。她想走得比你准备好的还快。",
  "You're not ready.": "你还没准备好。",
  "\"I really like you, and I'm not ready. Can we slow down?\"": "“我真的很喜欢你，但我还没准备好。我们可以慢一点吗？”",
  "Oh! Okay. Yes. Thanks for telling me. ...I thought boys always wanted to.": "哦！好。可以。谢谢你跟我说。……我还以为男生都会想。",
  "Boys get to say \"not yet\" too. Same weight.": "男生也可以说“还没”。分量一样。",
  "Go along so you don't look uncool.": "为了不显得逊，就顺着她。",
  "You went along to protect an image. Next time, protect you.": "你顺着走，是为了保住形象。下次，保护你自己。",
  "Make an excuse. \"My mum is waiting.\"": "找借口。“我妈在等我。”",
  "It works. But next time you'll need another excuse. And another. The truth only needs saying once.": "有用。但下次你还要另一个借口。再下次又一个。真话只要讲一次。",
  "My nenek's 70th birthday kenduri! You're coming. Wear something with a collar. NOT the basketball jersey.": "我奈奈的七十大寿宴！你要来。穿有领子的。不要穿篮球衣。",
  "Haziq's grandmother's flat. Twenty relatives, rendang, nasi minyak, and every aunty is looking at you.": "哈齐克阿嫲的组屋。二十个亲戚、仁当、油饭，每个安娣都在看你。",
  "How do you handle Haziq's family?": "哈齐克的家人，你怎么应对？",
  "Shoes off, salam his nenek properly, ask his cousins stuff, help clear the plates.": "脱鞋，好好跟他奈奈行礼，跟他表亲聊天，帮忙收碗。",
  "My nenek says you're \"a good boy\". She has never said that about me.": "我奈奈说你是个“好孩子”。她从来没这样说过我。",
  "Sit in the corner on your phone.": "坐在角落滑手机。",
  "An aunty asks if you're feeling unwell. Twice.": "一个安娣问你是不是不舒服。问了两次。",
  "JC1 class chat": "初院一年级班级群",
  "[photo] lol look what someone sent me. is this the girl from 1T3??": "[照片] 哈哈看有人传什么给我。这是1T3那个女生吗？？",
  "A classmate's private photo is going around.": "一个同学的私密照在流传。",
  "Don't open it, don't forward it. Tell Ryan to delete it, and tell a teacher.": "不打开，不转发。叫瑞安删掉，然后告诉老师。",
  "delete it. sharing someone's private photo without consent is a crime, and she's a minor. not funny.": "删掉。没经过同意分享别人的私密照是犯法的，而且她未成年。一点都不好笑。",
  "...ok. deleted.": "……好。删了。",
  "Forward it to the boys' chat.": "转发到男生群。",
  "Forwarding someone's intimate image without consent is abuse and an offence in Singapore at any age, and far more serious when the person is a minor. Every forward multiplies the harm. The only right move: don't open, don't forward, report.": "未经同意转发别人的私密照，在新加坡不管几岁都是虐待，也是罪行；对方是未成年人的话更严重。每转发一次，伤害就加倍。唯一正确的做法：不打开、不转发、举报。",
  "Mei's birthday is next week. Huge surprise party? She's told me three times she hates surprises.": "小美下礼拜生日。办个超大惊喜派对？她跟我说过三次她讨厌惊喜。",
  "Mei's birthday...": "小美的生日……",
  "Ask her what she wants. Do that.": "问她想要什么。照做。",
  "Laksa, a movie, and nobody singing at me? You know me.": "叻沙、一部电影、没人对着我唱生日歌？你很懂我。",
  "Surprise party anyway.": "还是办惊喜派对。",
  "I said NO surprises. Three times. I'm leaving in ten minutes.": "我说了不要惊喜。三次。我十分钟后就走。",
  "East Coast, bro. Let's rate the girls walking past. Out of ten.": "东海岸啊兄弟。来给经过的女生打分。满分十分。",
  "The boys are waiting.": "男生们在等。",
  "\"Not cool, man. Satay?\"": "“这样很不OK。吃沙爹？”",
  "Satay. Yes. Ryan, shut up.": "沙爹。好。瑞安，闭嘴。",
  "Join in.": "加入。",
  "People walking in a park. Not a score sheet.": "她们是在公园散步的人，不是评分表。",
  "At a classmate's party, a girl you barely know dares you to kiss her while everyone counts down.": "在同学的派对上，一个你几乎不认识的女生，在大家倒数的时候叫你亲她。",
  "You don't want to.": "你不想。",
  "\"Nah, I'm good.\" Smile, and mean it.": "“不用了，我OK。”笑一笑，是真心的。",
  "Your no counts. Same as anyone's.": "你的“不要”也算数。跟任何人一样。",
  "Do it so you don't look uncool.": "为了不显得逊，就亲了。",
  "Everyone cheers. You feel weird for the rest of the night.": "大家欢呼。你整晚都觉得怪怪的。",
  "Christmas Eve at the Diallo flat. Inès invited half the debate circuit. Thieboudienne at one end of the table, a Breton butter cake at the other. Her dad says grace in Wolof, her mum in French.": "迪亚洛家的平安夜。伊内丝邀了半个辩论圈的人。桌子一头是塞内加尔鱼饭，另一头是布列塔尼黄油蛋糕。她爸用沃洛夫语祷告，她妈用法语。",
  "Yes, I wear my Tabaski boubou to Christmas. My mother says it's festive enough for both. She is correct, for once.": "对，我穿宰牲节的长袍过圣诞。我妈说这件够喜庆，两个节日都适用。难得一次，她说对了。",
  "At nine, her phone rings. A video call from Dakar, her grandmother. Inès takes it into the corridor. When she comes back, her eyes are red.": "九点，她的手机响了。达喀尔打来的视频通话，是她奶奶。伊内丝拿着手机走到走廊。回来的时候，眼睛红红的。",
  "Allergies. The butter cake. Very aggressive butter.": "过敏。黄油蛋糕。非常有攻击性的黄油。",
  "She cried after her grandmother's call and blamed the cake.": "她跟奶奶通完电话后哭了，却怪到蛋糕头上。",
  "She sits down next to you without looking at anyone.": "她在你旁边坐下，谁都不看。",
  "Don't argue, don't fix. Just sit with her. \"Tell me about her?\"": "不争辩，也不想办法。就陪她坐着。“跟我说说她？”",
  "...She sells fabric at Marché HLM. She calls me \"ma petite avocate\". My little lawyer. I haven't seen her in two years.": "……她在 Marché HLM 卖布。她叫我“ma petite avocate”，我的小律师。我两年没见到她了。",
  "She told you about her grandmother instead of making a joke.": "她跟你说了奶奶的事，而不是开个玩笑带过。",
  "\"Allergies, right. Pass the cake?\"": "“过敏，对啦。蛋糕递给我？”",
  "Exactly. Allergies. Thank you for believing me.": "没错。过敏。谢谢你相信我。",
  "She offered you an exit and you took it. Sometimes the kind move is not to.": "她给了你一个台阶，你就下了。有时候，体贴的做法是不下。",
  "Same week, the Tan Rojas flat in Bedok. A novena with his mum's prayer group in the living room, buñuelos on every plate. Then his dad lights joss sticks at the ancestor altar, and Mateo bows three times beside him.": "同一个星期，勿洛的陈·罗哈斯家。他妈妈的祈祷小组在客厅做九日敬礼，每个盘子上都有炸奶酪球。然后他爸在祖先神台点香，马特奥站在他旁边拜了三拜。",
  "Both, bro. Jesús and Ah Gong. Nobody fights. Ah Gong also gets buñuelos.": "两个都拜，兄弟。耶稣和阿公。没人吵架。阿公也有炸奶酪球吃。",
  "Over dessert he tells the story of his graduation in Medellín. His dad was on a ship in the Gulf and missed it. Mateo does all the voices. Everyone laughs. He laughs loudest.": "吃甜点的时候，他讲起自己在麦德林毕业那天。他爸在海湾的船上，没能来。马特奥模仿每个人的声音。大家都笑了。他笑得最大声。",
  "He turned his dad missing his graduation into a comedy bit.": "他把爸爸错过他毕业这件事，讲成了一段搞笑表演。",
  "Later, washing up together.": "后来，你们一起洗碗。",
  "\"You don't have to make it funny, you know.\"": "“你知道吗，你不一定要把它讲得很好笑。”",
  "...Sí. I know. It was the one day I really wanted him there. Then I moved here for him, and he's still on ships.": "……Sí。我知道。那是我唯一真的很想他在场的一天。后来我为了他搬来这里，他还是在船上。",
  "He stopped joking when you told him he didn't have to.": "你说他不必搞笑之后，他就不再开玩笑了。",
  "Okay. Enough. Gracias, hermano. Dry the plates. You're bad at it.": "好啦。够了。Gracias，hermano。擦盘子。你擦得很烂。",
  "Laugh again. \"Bro, the voices!\"": "再笑一次：“兄弟，那些声音太好笑了！”",
  "He does the voices again. His eyes don't quite join in.": "他又模仿了一次。他的眼睛没有跟着笑。",
  "CNY eve. Chloe's family stall has a queue to the car park. On the counter, half-hidden under a tray: a letter from the bank with \"FINAL REMINDER\" in red.": "除夕。可儿家的摊位排队排到停车场。柜台上，一个托盘半遮着一封银行的信，上面红字写着“最后通知”。",
  "Don't look at that. We're fine. We don't need anyone's help.": "别看那个。我们没事。我们不需要任何人帮忙。",
  "She hid her dad's debt letter and refused help.": "她藏起爸爸的欠款信，拒绝别人帮忙。",
  "The queue is getting longer.": "队伍越排越长。",
  "Don't mention money. Grab an apron and pack kueh boxes for three hours.": "不提钱。拿条围裙，帮忙装三个小时的糕点盒。",
  "You helped with labour, not cash.": "你帮的是人手，不是钱。",
  "...You fold boxes badly. Thank you. Really.": "……你盒子折得好烂。谢谢。真的。",
  "Offer her your red-packet money for the debt.": "把你的红包钱拿给她还债。",
  "Put that away. I'm not a charity case.": "收起来。我不是被救济的对象。",
  "Kind thought, wrong currency. She wanted a hand, not a handout.": "心意是好的，但给错了东西。她要的是一双手，不是施舍。",
  "\"You don't have to prove anything to me, you know.\"": "“你知道吗，你不用向我证明什么。”",
  "...Nobody's said that to me before. Okay. Pass me the tongs.": "……从来没有人跟我讲过这句话。好。把夹子递给我。",
  "She let you see she was scared.": "她让你看到她其实很害怕。",
  "Day two of CNY at Ah Ma's flat, one block away. The TV is on Channel 8, the pineapple tarts are on the good plate, and she has a red packet for you she definitely cannot afford.": "初二，在隔壁座的阿嬷家。电视开着第八波道，黄梨挞放在最好的盘子上，她还准备了一个她肯定负担不起的红包给你。",
  "Take, take! Study hard. Don't spend on nonsense.": "拿去，拿去！好好读书。不要乱花钱。",
  "She gave you a red packet she could barely afford.": "她给了你一个她几乎负担不起的红包。",
  "Come, help Ah Ma. The phone class at the CC give homework. How to video call? I keep calling the wrong uncle.": "来，帮阿嬷。民众俱乐部的手机班有功课。视频通话要怎么打？我一直打错给另一个舅舅。",
  "Ah Ma holds out her phone like it might bite.": "阿嬷把手机伸过来，好像它会咬人一样。",
  "Sit with her, slowly. Let her press every button herself.": "陪她坐下，慢慢来。让她自己按每一个键。",
  "She learned the video call in ten minutes once nobody rushed her.": "没人催的时候，她十分钟就学会了视频通话。",
  "Aiyah, so easy one! Why the teacher talk so fast?": "哎呀，这么简单的！老师为什么讲那么快？",
  "Ah Ma! You came to my CC class! ...Oh, hi. She's my best student. Don't tell the others.": "阿嬷！你来上我在民众俱乐部的课！……哦，嗨。她是我最好的学生。别跟其他人讲。",
  "While you're on her phone...": "既然你拿着她的手机……",
  "Install ScamShield and save \"Call grandson first\" as her favourite contact.": "帮她装 ScamShield，再把“先打给孙子”设成她的常用联系人。",
  "Got police call, I call you first? Okay. Ah Ma remember.": "有警察打来，我先打给你？好。阿嬷记住了。",
  "Just fix the video call. She's fine.": "帮她弄好视频通话就好。她没事的。",
  "Do it for her, fast, and hand it back.": "帮她快快弄好，然后还给她。",
  "Wah, so fast. ...Then next time how? I ask you again lor.": "哇，这么快。……那下次怎么办？我再问你咯。",
  "She said she'd rather not bother you again.": "她说她宁愿不要再麻烦你。",
  "Sunday afternoon at the void deck. Joy, who looks after Xin Yi's grandmother, is on her day off with a notebook full of diagrams.": "礼拜天下午，组屋楼下。照顾欣怡奶奶的乔伊今天休假，拿着一本画满图表的笔记本。",
  "Joy waves. The notebook says \"Caregiving Course, Module 4\".": "乔伊跟你挥手。笔记本上写着“看护课程，第四单元”。",
  "Ask what she's studying.": "问她在读什么。",
  "Dementia care. Advanced. The exam is in Tagalog AND English, so I'm studying twice. When I go home to Iloilo, I want to open a day centre.": "失智症护理，高级班。考试有他加禄语也有英文，所以我要读两遍。等我回伊洛伊洛，我想开一间日间护理中心。",
  "You asked about her course.": "你问了她的课程。",
  "Nod and keep walking.": "点点头，继续走。"
});
